{"5147810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Void Sector", "steam_appid": 5147810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTO THE ABYSS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b8fa6631e4e26f9a40bfbabc3264a4df.poster.avif?t=1788008154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b8fa6631e4e26f9a40bfbabc3264a4df.webm?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b8fa6631e4e26f9a40bfbabc3264a4df.mp4?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the secret bioweapons research facility alone or with up to 3 of your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the infected victims of the failed experiment, recover any surviving research, repair life support systems, and extract in time or explore further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission takes you deeper into the facility, where the atmosphere becomes more suffocating, enemies are stronger, and the organism shows you it’s true self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the less the facility feels like a facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEVER THE SAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b62b3fc26b345b1f6419a4a458cba5b9.poster.avif?t=1788008154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b62b3fc26b345b1f6419a4a458cba5b9.webm?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b62b3fc26b345b1f6419a4a458cba5b9.mp4?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted environments assembled through procedural map generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always different rooms, layouts, objectives, and tasks from run to run, as your choices will always lead to different outcomes in the following sector, pushing you and your team to adapt to the more and more violent and suffocating enviroment while your own hallucinations are torturing you as the organism is slowly taking over your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deeper into the facility and see how the escaped life form took over everything already.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >INTO THE ABYSS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b8fa6631e4e26f9a40bfbabc3264a4df.poster.avif?t=1788008154\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b8fa6631e4e26f9a40bfbabc3264a4df.webm?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b8fa6631e4e26f9a40bfbabc3264a4df.mp4?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the secret bioweapons research facility alone or with up to 3 of your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the infected victims of the failed experiment, recover any surviving research, repair life support systems, and extract in time or explore further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission takes you deeper into the facility, where the atmosphere becomes more suffocating, enemies are stronger, and the organism shows you it’s true self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the less the facility feels like a facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NEVER THE SAME</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b62b3fc26b345b1f6419a4a458cba5b9.poster.avif?t=1788008154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b62b3fc26b345b1f6419a4a458cba5b9.webm?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/extras/b62b3fc26b345b1f6419a4a458cba5b9.mp4?t=1788008154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hand-crafted environments assembled through procedural map generation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always different rooms, layouts, objectives, and tasks from run to run, as your choices will always lead to different outcomes in the following sector, pushing you and your team to adapt to the more and more violent and suffocating enviroment while your own hallucinations are torturing you as the organism is slowly taking over your own mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture deeper into the facility and see how the escaped life form took over everything already.</p>", "short_description": "Void Sector is a 1 to 4 player co-op action-horror game. Board a secret facility as a spec-ops unit and discover the weapon that escaped the lab. Solving problems and completing tasks only adds to the atmosphere and the struggle to survive the mutated enemies and your soldier’s mental deterioration.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Hungarian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/03b3fe297805c0fa759d5f87bbedc7b0a4ad0f96/header.jpg?t=1788008154", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/3a6e1ea449556f99a1c6868dce6d200e9e2cff1a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788008154", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/3a6e1ea449556f99a1c6868dce6d200e9e2cff1a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788008154", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Preda Games"], "publishers": ["Preda Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/1bdf49503c6786a7bdba5d70ae69122947853246/ss_1bdf49503c6786a7bdba5d70ae69122947853246.600x338.jpg?t=1788008154", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/1bdf49503c6786a7bdba5d70ae69122947853246/ss_1bdf49503c6786a7bdba5d70ae69122947853246.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788008154"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5147810/f